ого помещения для временного проживания в них.</p>\n</div>\n\";s:20:\"text_selected_editor\";s:7:\"tinymce\";s:5:\"autop\";b:1;s:12:\"_sow_form_id\";s:31:\"5463350195c7bda263e74b603309073\";s:19:\"_sow_form_timestamp\";s:13:\"1551707331628\";s:22:\"so_sidebar_emulator_id\";s:19:\"sow-editor-26340006\";s:11:\"option_name\";s:17:\"widget_sow-editor\";s:11:\"panels_info\";a:7:{s:5:\"class\";s:31:\"SiteOrigin_Widget_Editor_Widget\";s:3:\"raw\";b:0;s:4:\"grid\";i:2;s:4:\"cell\";i:0;s:2:\"id\";i:6;s:9:\"widget_id\";s:36:\"c3200909-63f9-4e8c-966f-e050ab2ad500\";s:5:\"style\";a:6:{s:10:\"widget_css\";s:79:\"background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\npadding: 30px;\nfont-size: 22px;\nline-height: 32px;\";s:14:\"mobile_padding\";s:15:\"0px 0px 0px 0px\";s:27:\"background_image_attachment\";b:0;s:18:\"background_display\";s:4:\"tile\";s:6:\"margin\";s:13:\"0% 15% 0% 15%\";s:10:\"font_color\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";}}}i:7;a:9:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:230:\"<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">ПОЛУЧИТЬ КОНСУЛЬТАЦИЮ:</h2>\n<div id=\"block-new164\" class=\"block block-image is-image\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[contact-form-7 id=\"121\" title=\"Заявка блок 3\"]</div>\n\";s:20:\"text_selected_editor\";s:7:\"tinymce\";s:5:\"autop\";b:1;s:12:\"_sow_form_id\";s:32:\"17952236375c7bdaf633467445779952\";s:19:\"_sow_form_timestamp\";s:13:\"1558949501317\";s:22:\"so_sidebar_emulator_id\";s:19:\"sow-editor-26340007\";s:11:\"option_name\";s:17:\"widget_sow-editor\";s:11:\"panels_info\";a:7:{s:5:\"class\";s:31:\"SiteOrigin_Widget_Editor_Widget\";s:3:\"raw\";b:0;s:4:\"grid\";i:2;s:4:\"cell\";i:0;s:2:\"id\";i:7;s:9:\"widget_id\";s:36:\"589b717f-a4da-4598-b1c6-6da49867716f\";s:5:\"style\";a:6:{s:10:\"widget_css\";s:60:\"background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\npadding: 20px;\nfont-size: 22px;\";s:14:\"mobile_padding\";s:15:\"0px 0px 0px 0px\";s:27:\"background_image_attachment\";b:0;s:18:\"background_display\";s:4:\"tile\";s:6:\"margin\";s:13:\"0% 15% 0% 15%\";s:10:\"font_color\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";}}}i:8;a:9:{s:5