div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">40 кВт<sup>2</sup></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> мощность электросети. Возможно увеличение </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"><sup></sup></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> точки доступа водопровода и канализации </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> пол-бетонная стяжка после строителей </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> стены-утепленный металопрофиль </span></div>\n</div>\";s:20:\"text_selected_editor\";s:4:\"html\";s:12:\"_sow_form_id\";s:31:\"5281221675c7bbd30e056d995254798\";s:19:\"_sow_form_timestamp\";s:13:\"1559114207764\";s:11:\"panels_info\";a:6:{s:5:\"class\";s:31:\"SiteOrigin_Widget_Editor_Widget\";s:4:\"grid\";i:0;s:4:\"cell\";i:0;s:2:\"id\";i:0;s:9:\"widget_id\";s:36:\"5e9aaa3d-943a-4433-87bc-4d4320520c01\";s:5:\"style\";a:14:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"widget_css\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"mobile_css\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"margin\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"padding\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"mobile_padding\";s:15:\"0px 0px 0px 0px\";s:10:\"background\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";s:27:\"background_image_attachment\";s:1:\"0\";s:36:\"background_image_attachment_fallback\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"background_display\";s:4:\"tile\";s:12:\"border_color\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"font_color\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"link_color\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"autop\";b:0;s:22:\"so_sidebar_emulator_id\";s:19:\"sow-editor-29340000\";s:11:\"option_name\";s:17:\"widget_sow-editor\";}}s:5:\"grids\";a:1:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:\"cells\";i:1;s:5:\"style\";a:18:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"cell_class\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"row_css\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"mobile_css\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"bottom_margin\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"gutter\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"padding\";s:11