ций и коммуникаций</span> </span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3\"><span class=\"ramah\"> 8 этажей </span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"><span class=\"rama\"> <span>включая технический, максимальная высота 40 м</span> </span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3\"><span class=\"ramah\"> 12 м/м  </span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> <span> механизированный паркинг башенного типа</span> </span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>','Главная','','inherit','closed','closed','','15-revision-v1','','','2019-03-03 15:34:13','2019-03-03 12:34:13','',15,'http://goldinvest.com.ua/2019/03/03/15-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(118,1,'2019-03-03 15:34:13','2019-03-03 12:34:13','<div id=\"pl-15\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-15-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  data-style=\"{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;bg_optic&quot;,&quot;row_css&quot;:&quot;min-height: 90vh;&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;38&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;fixed&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\"  data-ratio=\"1\"  data-ratio-direction=\"right\" ><div class=\"bg_optic panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-15-0\" ><div id=\"pgc-15-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\"  data-weight=\"1\" ><div id=\"panel-15-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child\" data-index=\"0\" data-style=\"{&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0% 10% 0% 10%&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;}\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-0-0-0\" ><div id=\"pl-w5c7ab749a75bc\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w5c7ab749a75bc-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\"  data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot