&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;border_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;link_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w5c7d2f3807a64-0-0-0\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ТЕХНИЧЕСКИЕ ХАРАКТЕРИСТИКИ:</h1>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">730 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> общая площадь существующего здания </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">515 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> общая площадь земельного участка (под зданием и смежная)</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">4 этажа</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> общая площадь земельного участка (под зданием и смежная)</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ПРОЕКТ РЕКОНСТРУКЦИИ</h1>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">2 550 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> ориентировочная площадь по проекту реконструкции с учетом градостроительной ситуации </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">2400 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> общая полезная площадь с учетом конструкций и коммуникаций </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"> 8 этажей </span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> включая технический, максимальная высота 40 м </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"> 12 м/м </span></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> механизированный паркинг башенного типа </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"pg-15-2\" class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" data-style=\"{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;bg_optic&quot;,&quot;row_css&quot;:&quot;min-height: 90vh;&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;122&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;fixed&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-ratio-direction=\"right\">\r\n<div class=\"bg_optic panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-15-2\">\r\n<div id=\"pgc-15-2-0\" class=\"panel-grid-cell\" data-weight=\"1\">\r\n<div id=\"panel-15-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child\" data-index=\"5\" data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;resave&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;3% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\">\r\n<div id=\"resave\" class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-2-0-0\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ВОЗМОЖНЫЕ ВАРИАНТЫ ИСПОЛЬЗОВАНИЯ ЗЕМЕЛЬНОГО УЧАСТКА</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"panel-15-2-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor\" data-index=\"6\" data-style=\"{&quot;widget_css&quot;:&quot;background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\\npadding: 30px;\\nfont-size: 22px;\\nline-height: 32px;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;margin&quot;:&quot;0% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-2-0-1\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<div id=\"block-new164\" class=\"block block-image is-image\"><strong>Деловое управление </strong>- код 4.1. Размещение объектов капитального строительства с целью: размещения объектов управленческой деятельности, не связанной с государственным или муниципальным управлением и</div>\r\n<div id=\"block-new169\" class=\"block block-text is-text\">\r\n\r\nоказанием услуг, а также с целью обеспечения совершения сделок, не требующих передачи товара в момент их совершения между организациями, в том числе биржевая деятельность (за исключением банковской и страховой деятельности).\r\n\r\n<strong>Гостиничное обслуживание</strong> – код 4.7. Размещение гостиниц, а также иных зданий, используемых с целью извлечения предпринимательской выгоды из предоставления жилого помещения для временного проживания в них.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"panel-15-2-0-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-last-child\" data-index=\"7\" data-style=\"{&quot;widget_css&quot;:&quot;background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\\npadding: 20px;\\nfont-size: 22px;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;margin&quot;:&quot;0% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-2-0-2\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">УЗНАЙТЕ БОЛЬШЕ О ЗЕМЕЛЬНОМ УЧАСТКЕ</h2>\r\n<div id=\"block-new164\" class=\"block block-image is-image\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[contact-form-7 id=\"121\" title=\"Заявка блок 3\"]</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"pg-15-3\" class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" data-style=\"{&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-ratio-direction=\"right\">\r\n<div id=\"pgc-15-3-0\" class=\"panel-grid-cell\" data-weight=\"1\">\r\n<div id=\"panel-15-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"8\" data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;plans&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;}\">\r\n<div id=\"plans\" class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-3-0-0\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ФОТО ПОМЕЩЕНИЯ</h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[smartslider3 slider=2]</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"pg-15-4\" class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" data-style=\"{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;bg_optic&quot;,&quot;row_css&quot;:&quot;min-height: 90vh;&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;146&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;fixed&quot;,&quot;bottom_margin&quot;:&quot;0px&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-ratio-direction=\"right\">\r\n<div class=\"bg_optic panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-15-4\">\r\n<div id=\"pgc-15-4-0\" class=\"panel-grid-cell\" data-weight=\"1\">\r\n<div id=\"panel-15-4-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child\" data-index=\"9\" data-style=\"{&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;3% 15% 15% 15%&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-4-0-0\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">СОЗДАЙТЕ СОБСВЕННЫЙ УНИКАЛЬНЫЙ\r\nПРОЕКТ В ЦЕНТРЕ ГОРОДА</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"panel-15-4-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-last-child\" data-index=\"10\" data-style=\"{&quot;widget_css&quot;:&quot;background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\\npadding: 20px;\\nfont-size: 22px;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;margin&quot;:&quot;0% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-4-0-1\">\r\n<div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\r\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">УЗНАЙТЕ БОЛЬШЕ О ВАРИАНТАХ РЕКОНСТРУКЦИИ</h2>\r\n<div id=\"block-new164\" class=\"block block-image is-image\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[contact-form-7 id=\"121\" title=\"Заявка блок 3\"]</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"pg-15-5\" class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;adress&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;bottom_margin&quot;:&quot;0px&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-ratio-direction=\"right\">\r\n<div id=\"adress\" class=\"panel-row-style panel-row-sty