le panel-widget-style-for-15-1-0-0\" ><div id=\"pl-w5ced3be5cd07e\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w5ced3be5cd07e-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;cell_class&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;row_css&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mobile_css&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;bottom_margin&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;gutter&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0% 0% 0% 0%&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;row_stretch&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;collapse_behaviour&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;collapse_order&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;,&quot;background&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;border_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\"  data-ratio=\"1\"  data-ratio-direction=\"right\" ><div class=\"panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-w5ced3be5cd07e-0\" ><div id=\"pgc-w5ced3be5cd07e-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\"  data-weight=\"1\" ><div id=\"panel-w5ced3be5cd07e-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"0\" data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;widget_css&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mobile_css&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;margin&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;border_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;link_color&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w5ced3be5cd07e-0-0-0\" ><div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n	<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ТЕХНИЧЕСКАЯ ХАРАКТЕРИСТИКА</h1>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">380 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> общая площадь существующего здания </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"> <sup></sup></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\">сдается частями (нарезка) 75м2, 150м2, 230м2</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">3,2м</span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> минимальная высота потолков</span></div>\n</div>\n<br /><br />\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ПРОЕКТ РЕКОНСТРУКЦИИ</h1>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">2 550 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> ориентировочная площадь по проекту реконструкции с учетом градостроительной ситуации </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\">2400 м<sup>2</sup></span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> общая полезная площадь с учетом конструкций и коммуникаций </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"> 8 этажей </span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> включая технический, максимальная высота 40 м </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\"><span class=\"ramah\"> 12 м/м </span></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\"><span class=\"rama\"> механизированный паркинг башенного типа </span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"pg-15-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  data-style=\"{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;bg_optic&quot;,&quot;row_css&quot;:&quot;min-height: 90vh;&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:&quot;122&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment_fallback&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;fixed&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\"  data-ratio=\"1\"  data-ratio-direction=\"right\" ><div class=\"bg_optic panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-15-2\" ><div id=\"pgc-15-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\"  data-weight=\"1\" ><div id=\"panel-15-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child\" data-index=\"5\" data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;resave&quot;,&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;3% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\" ><div id=\"resave\" class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-2-0-0\" ><div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n	<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">ПОМЕЩЕНИЕ И ИНФРАСТРУКТУРА</h1>\n</div>\n</div></div></div><div id=\"panel-15-2-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor\" data-index=\"6\" data-style=\"{&quot;widget_css&quot;:&quot;background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\\npadding: 30px;\\nfont-size: 22px;\\nline-height: 32px;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;margin&quot;:&quot;0% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-2-0-1\" ><div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n	<div id=\"block-new164\" class=\"block block-image is-image\"><strong>Деловое управление </strong>- код 4.1. Размещение объектов капитального строительства с целью: размещения объектов управленческой деятельности, не связанной с государственным или муниципальным управлением и</div>\n<div id=\"block-new169\" class=\"block block-text is-text\">\n<p>оказанием услуг, а также с целью обеспечения совершения сделок, не требующих передачи товара в момент их совершения между организациями, в том числе биржевая деятельность (за исключением банковской и страховой деятельности).</p>\n<p><strong>Гостиничное обслуживание</strong> – код 4.7. Размещение гостиниц, а также иных зданий, используемых с целью извлечения предпринимательской выгоды из предоставления жилого помещения для временного проживания в них.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div><div id=\"panel-15-2-0-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-last-child\" data-index=\"7\" data-style=\"{&quot;widget_css&quot;:&quot;background-color: #0a0a0a8a;\\npadding: 20px;\\nfont-size: 22px;&quot;,&quot;mobile_padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 0px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;margin&quot;:&quot;0% 15% 0% 15%&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-2-0-2\" ><div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n	<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">ПОЛУЧИТЬ КОНСУЛЬТАЦИЮ:</h2>\n<div id=\"block-new164\" class=\"block block-image is-image\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[contact-form-7 id=\"121\" title=\"Заявка блок 3\"]</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"pg-15-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\"  data-style=\"{&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;cell_alignment&quot;:&quot;flex-start&quot;}\"  data-ratio=\"1\"  data-ratio-direction=\"right\" ><div id=\"pgc-15-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\"  data-weight=\"1\" ><div id=\"panel-15-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"8\" data-style=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;plans&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&qu