<span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><a style=\"color: #ff9900;\" href=\"#popmake-66\">СТОИМОСТЬ</a></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"panel-15-0-0-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor\" data-index=\"2\" data-style=\"{&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;5% 5% 0% 5%&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;,&quot;font_color&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-0-0-2\" ><div class=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\">\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n	<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">АРЕНДА ПОМЕЩЕНИЯ ПОД\nСАЛОН-МАГАЗИН</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">(75м2, 150м2, 210м2, 380м2)</h1>\n&nbsp;\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Проспект Григоренка, 32Д</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Метро Позняки</h2>\n&nbsp;\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Прямая аренда от собственника помещения</h4></div>\n</div></div></div><div id=\"panel-15-0-0-3\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-button panel-last-child\" data-index=\"3\" data-style=\"{&quot;padding&quot;:&quot;0px 0px 30px 0px&quot;,&quot;background_image_attachment&quot;:false,&quot;background_display&quot;:&quot;tile&quot;}\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-15-0-0-3\" >[siteorigin_widget class=\"SiteOrigin_Widget_Button_Widget\"]<input type=\"hidden\" value=\"{&quot;instance&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\u041e\\u0442\\u043a\\u0440\\u043e\\u0439\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0441\\u0432\\u043e\\u0439 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0438\\u0431\\u044b\\u043b\\u044c\\u043d\\u044b\\u0439 \\u043c\\u0430\\u0433\\u0430\\u0437\\u0438\\u043d \\u043d\\u0430 \\u041f\\u043e\\u0437\\u043d\\u044f\\u043a\\u0430\\u0445&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;#resave&quot;,&quot;button_icon&quot;:{&quot;icon_selected&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;icon_color&quot;:false,&quot;icon&quot;:0,&quot;icon_placement&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;so_field_container_s